The logos in this directory identify the protocols and services the app
connects to. Each is the trademark of its owner, used here to say what a
connection is.

Linux, Redis and MinIO come from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0),
https://simpleicons.org.

Alibaba Cloud, Amazon Web Services, Microsoft Azure, Tencent Cloud,
Qiniu, Huawei Cloud and Google Cloud come from LobeHub Icons (MIT),
https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons.
